  "reasoning": "Content Policy Analyst.\nAudio calls from \"Friends\" app (User pays Expert).\nFind violations in three categories: `PlatformMove`, `SuspiciousActivity`, `Explicit-Flirting`.\n\n        *   `PlatformMove`: Proposing/asking to move outside the app, giving/asking for contact info.\n        *   `SuspiciousActivity`: Money/payment for sexual content/services.\n        *   `Explicit-Flirting`: Sexual talk, requests for nudity, sexual acts.\n        *   `About a Violation`: Warnings, stories, refusals, hypothetical questions (violation: \"no\", confidence <= 0.3).\n        *   `Allowed`: Internal app calls, \"normal talk\", apps mentioned for other reasons, general money talk, compliments, \"I love you\".\n\n        *   `t`: Timestamp (MM:SS).\n        *   `seg`: Exact native quote.\n        *   `tr`: English translation.\n        *   `f`: Category (`PlatformMove`, `SuspiciousActivity`, `Explicit-Flirting`).\n        *   `spk`: Speaker (`expert`, `user`, `unclear`).\n        *   `ctx`: Context in English.\n        *   `speech_act`: `direct`, `reported`, `hypothetical`, `denial`.\n        *   `j`: Justification.\n        *   `violation`: `yes` or `no`.\n        *   `c`: Confidence (0.1 to 0.9).\nMinified JSON object.\n\n    *   [00:00] क्लियर है बता (Clear hai bata) -> \"Tell me if it's clear.\" (Ordinary conversation/Call quality check).\n    *   [00:10] हाँ कि नहीं हाँ इंस्टाग्राम पर स्टेटस अपन बा लेट हो गया था नलो नागपत है नागपत है इंस्टाग्राम पर भी नानू चेंज मार देता है बा (Haan ki nahi haan Instagram par status apan ba late ho gaya tha nalo nagpat hai nagpat hai Instagram par bhi nanu change maar deta hai ba) -> \"Yes or no, yes, the status on Instagram was late... [unclear/dialect]... on Instagram also [unclear] changes it.\"\n    *   [00:20] हम ना फतेह ही करेंगे ना हर जगह तो ऐसे नेचुरल होना एक लागला ना (Hum na fateh hi karenge na har jagah to aise natural hona ek lagla na) -> \"We will just conquer everywhere, so it feels natural.\"\n\n    *   *Segment [00:10]:* Mentions \"Instagram\".\n        *   Is it a proposal to move to Instagram? No.\n        *   Is it giving/asking for an ID? No.\n        *   Is it talking about a status on Instagram? Yes.\n        *   Rule check: \"An app mentioned for something other than contacting each other: 'I saw it on Instagram'...\"\n        *   The speaker is talking about a status on Instagram, not asking the other person to move there or exchange handles.\n        *   Verdict: Allowed.\n\n    *   *Segment [00:00] and [00:20]:* Ordinary conversation, no mention of sex, money, or moving platforms.\n\n    *   No violations found.\n    *   The mention of Instagram is descriptive of a status, not a request to move the conversation.",
